</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Capital Punishment</span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Life imprisonment without parole</span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Life imprisonment with parole</span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Maximum statutory sentencing recommendation</span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Time served</span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="font-size:16px">[ ] - Other: <mark class="unfilled" title="Other sentence">_____________________</mark></span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
&nbsp;
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px">
<span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-size:14px">(( Note: 1 Hour = 1 Day, 1 Day = 1 Month, 1 Month = 1 Year. ))&nbsp;</span></span>
</p>
